---
title: Placing the start
---
Decide where the start should be, then put it on the nearest tile that is open [[t:241-243 s:25]].

## The rule
```text
choose a desired point: the middle of the left edge, or the center
the start is the open tile nearest it, in a straight line
```

The demo measures every open tile’s straight-line distance to the desired point and takes the smallest [[c17:69-86 g]]. It does so on a map already culled, so the start can walk to everything that is left [[c17:34-67 t:236-237]].

