@@steps limit=4

## Controls
@@control at
`left` is the middle of the left edge [[c17:70]]. `center` is the middle of the map, where the talk’s demo of the farthest exit starts [[c19:69]].

## What it produces, measured
@@measured

A start changes no tile, so these are the culled caves’ traits [[own]].

